          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves, roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while this unit is within 6" of this model, that unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Siege Shield" id="bf78-bb59-a791-18b0" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While making ranged attacks, while making attacks made with demolisher cannon, while a friendly unit other than this unit is not within Engagement Range of the target unit, units can target this model with ranged weapons.
While making ranged attacks, this model ignores any negative modifiers to its Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="7f0a-35ad-e03b-c47c" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, subtract 1 from this model's Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
