        <profile name="Firing Deck" id="c8df-fa36-9e66-d72f" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This unit gains the Firing Deck X ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Sorcerous Support" id="2381-9e4b-5c58-53c4" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After this unit resolves its attacks, during your Shooting phase, until the end of the phase:
  - Select one enemy unit that was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit during that shooting sequence (your Sorcerous Support Target). Until the end of the phase, each time a friendly unit makes an attack against it:
    - If the attacking unit disembarked from this Transport this turn, while making psychic attacks, add 1 to friendly models' Hit rolls.
    - If the attacking unit disembarked from this Transport this turn, while making psychic attacks, add 1 to friendly models' Wound rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="89bc-ce8a-6a91-40e3" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves, roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while this unit is within 6" of this model, that unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
