          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Lord of the Planet of the Sorcerers (Psychic)" id="49d9-3c14-28d2-7141" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The number of uses of each RITUAL ability of this model is 2, but it can be used at most 2 times per turn.
Each time this unit attempts a Ritual, add 2 to this unit's Psychic rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Supreme Commander" id="8967-32f6-5c09-a376" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is friendly, this unit must be your Warlord.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Unearthly Power" id="0120-4f83-5352-731a" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the battle round, until the start of the next battle round:
  - Select one:
    - Impossible Form: Unless against psychic attacks, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of the attacking unit's attacks.
    - Treason of Tzeentch: At the start of your opponent's Shooting phase, until the end of the phase, select one enemy unit that is within 24" of this model; ranged weapons equipped by models in that unit gain [HAZARDOUS].
    - Time Flux: While a friendly THOUSAND SONS unit is within 6" of this model, add 2" to that unit's Move characteristic.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Impossible Form" id="50a1-86c0-fea8-d7df" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the battle round, unless against psychic attacks, until the start of the next battle round, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of the attacking unit's attacks.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Treason of Tzeentch" id="f772-cb91-4fc3-990c" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the battle round, until the start of the next battle round:
  - At the start of your opponent's Shooting phase, until the end of the phase:
    - Select one enemy unit that is within 24" of this model. Ranged weapons equipped by models in that unit gain [HAZARDOUS].</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Time Flux" id="6fa1-8c5a-307a-0c6b" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the battle round, until the start of the next battle round, while a friendly THOUSAND SONS unit is within 6" of this model, add 2" to that unit's Move characteristic.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="d559-dafb-56bf-400d" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this unit ends an Ingress move, while this unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="e17c-d521-d0d8-1965" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves, roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while this unit is within 6" of this model, that unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="f56e-40f7-0c37-9a8e" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, subtract 1 from this model's Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
