      <profiles>
        <profile name="Daemon Prince of Tzeentch with Wings" id="9a67-65eb-f46e-60ee" hidden="false" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">13"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="d29d-cf75-fc2d-34a4">9</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">2+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">6+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc">4+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">60mm</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Aetherstride (Psychic)" id="b943-f645-4651-baed" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is set up, you can use this ability, during your Movement phase, if the triggering unit was set up this phase and the triggering unit used the Deep Strike ability this phase, until the end of the turn:
  - This model resolves the Aetherstride ability now.
  - This unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 6" away from all enemy models.
  - Dark Blessing weapons equipped by this model gain [SUSTAINED HITS D3].
  - The triggering unit cannot declare a charge.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Hunter of Souls" id="4b57-f0bd-be57-2633" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Against CHARACTER targets:
  - You can re-roll Hit rolls of 1.
  - You can re-roll Wound rolls of 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="65fa-ab58-ff9e-bb02" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this unit ends an Ingress move, while this unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="56bd-1f05-00b7-ed9a" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves, roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while this unit is within 6" of this model, that unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
