        </profile>
        <profile name="Binding Tendrils (Psychic)" id="0673-cf71-2da7-5c18" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After this unit resolves its attacks, during your Shooting phase, until the start of your next turn:
  - Select one enemy INFANTRY unit that was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit by Arcane Fire during that shooting sequence:
    - That unit is ensnared.
    - While the selected unit is ensnared, subtract 2" from that unit's Move characteristic.
    - While the selected unit is ensnared, subtract 2 from that unit's Charge rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Illusions of Tzeentch (Psychic)" id="fa41-503f-a34a-f923" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is leading a unit and the attacking unit is within 18" of this unit, enemy units can target this unit with ranged weapons.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="8b57-3179-4705-ddf4" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
