          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="39be-0f2c-2651-6f1a" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, subtract 1 from this model's Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="e96a-8789-e008-d5d2" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves, roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while this unit is within 6" of this model, that unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="1d02-6afc-5d73-c88a" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this unit ends an Ingress move, while this unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="One Head Looks Back" id="925b-13c2-f3be-581c" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time your opponent uses a Stratagem, while that unit is within 12" of this model, increase the CP cost of that use of the Stratagem by 1 CP.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="One Head Looks Forward" id="c2dd-0ca5-d55d-293e" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the end of your Command phase, while this model is on the battlefield:
  - This model must take a Leadership test.
  - If the triggering leadership roll succeeded, you gain 1 CP.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
