        <profile name="HORRORS ARE PINK. HORRORS ARE BLUE. WHERE ONCE THERE WAS ONE, NOW THERE ARE TWO." id="5f88-22ec-dd12-7e2f" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">If this unit contains at most 0 PINK models:
  - This unit uses the Blue Horrors datasheet from now on, keeping its lost wounds and its position.
  - If this unit contains one or more PINK models, this unit loses the Sullen Malevolence ability.
  - If this unit contains one or more PINK models, this unit loses the Exploding Horrors ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Split" id="7aeb-91c4-35b5-0573" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When a friendly model with the BLUE or PINK keyword in this unit is destroyed, after the attacking unit has resolved its attacks, while this unit is on the battlefield:
  - Roll one D6: on a 4+, if that model has the PINK keyword, add 2 Blue Horror models to this unit; if that model has the BLUE keyword, add 1 Brimstone Horror model to this unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
