        <selectionEntryGroup name="Detachment" id="4e07-87eb-df36-dcab" hidden="false">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="16be-872f-4848-8388" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="Changehost of Deceit" id="6acc-9928-2b67-73c3" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="e837-d22f-08a9-fed3" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Infernal Pacts" id="03cb-8ef7-90ab-1e31" hidden="false">
                  <description>Friendly SCINTILLATING LEGIONS units gain the Daemonic Illusions ability:
  - While a friendly PSYKER THOUSAND SONS unit is within 6" of this unit and that unit is visible to this unit, against ranged attacks, that unit has a 4+ invulnerable save.
Friendly THOUSAND SONS units gain the Mortal Sorcery ability:
  - While a friendly PSYKER SCINTILLATING LEGIONS unit is within 6" of this unit and that unit is visible to this unit, that unit gains the Cabal of Sorcerers ability.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Reconnaissance" id="4606-227d-647d-48e1" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="b4a7-5083-fe94-4d24"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Warpforged Cabal" id="8839-1789-36e7-b66a" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="1200-9607-de51-06c7" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Warpfire Infusion" id="bab7-8ce4-ada7-86c5" hidden="false">
                  <description>Until the end of the phase:
  - When a friendly THOUSAND SONS VEHICLE unit is selected to shoot, you can use this ability or when a friendly THOUSAND SONS VEHICLE unit is selected to fight, you can use this ability:
    - While the triggering unit is within 6" of a friendly PSYKER THOUSAND SONS unit:
      - You can re-roll one Hit roll.
      - You can re-roll one Wound roll.
      - You can re-roll one Damage roll.
    - While the triggering unit is not within 6" of a friendly PSYKER THOUSAND SONS unit:
      Choose one of the following:
        - You can re-roll one Hit roll.
        - You can re-roll one Wound roll.
        - You can re-roll one Damage roll.
  - When a friendly THOUSAND SONS VEHICLE model in this unit is destroyed, while the triggering unit has the Deadly Demise ability and that model is within 6" of a friendly PSYKER THOUSAND SONS unit, the threshold of this model's Deadly Demise ability is 5.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Priority Assets" id="f395-22e0-fce3-7002" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="0936-9767-1cc7-52ae"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Hexwarp Thrallband" id="7b92-cca6-0617-1b6d" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="d661-09e9-1ab0-59fb" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Flow of Magic" id="8eca-330d-bf11-dfcf" hidden="false">
                  <description>Your deployment zone is within Flow of Magic. At the start of each phase, if you control at least half of the objectives in no man's land, no man's land is within Flow of Magic until the end of the phase (evaluated once at that time). At the start of each phase, if you control at least half of the objectives in your opponent's deployment zone, your opponent's deployment zone is within Flow of Magic until the end of the phase (evaluated once at that time). You can re-roll Wound rolls of 1 with weapons with [PSYCHIC]. If this model is wholly within Flow of Magic, add 1 to friendly THOUSAND SONS units' Wound rolls with weapons with [PSYCHIC] instead.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Take and Hold" id="1de0-d975-ffec-a36f" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="1cc1-f11a-4e8f-1bcc"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="3"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Grand Coven" id="9aba-cb08-cd38-9e01" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="b530-e51d-cdaf-fea6" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Kindred Sorcery" id="de20-736a-e032-e311" hidden="false">
                  <description>Until the start of your next Command phase:
  - At the start of your Command phase:
    - Select one (each can be chosen once per battle):
      - Imbued Manifestation: Add 6" to the Range characteristic of ranged weapons with [PSYCHIC] equipped by models in this unit.
      - Psychic Maelstrom: Add 1 to this unit's Wound rolls with weapons with [PSYCHIC].
      - Wrath of the Immaterium: Weapons with [PSYCHIC] equipped by models in this unit gain [DEVASTATING WOUNDS].</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Priority Assets" id="2ce5-12ac-896b-d9c6" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="0936-9767-1cc7-52ae"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="3"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Warpmeld Pact" id="5be7-3aa8-5d64-cbaf" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="0282-f5c0-2a23-812e" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Warpmeld Sacrifice" id="a2f2-ea70-4522-498f" hidden="false">
                  <description>Until the end of the phase:
  - When an enemy unit targets a friendly MUTANT TZEENTCH unit with the INFANTRY or MOUNTED keyword, you can use this ability:
    - If the target unit is the same unit as that unit, subtract 1 from the attacking unit's Wound rolls.
    - At the end of each phase, until the end of the phase, that unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.
  - When a friendly MUTANT TZEENTCH unit with the INFANTRY or MOUNTED keyword is selected to shoot, you can use this ability or when a friendly MUTANT TZEENTCH unit with the INFANTRY or MOUNTED keyword is selected to fight, you can use this ability:
    - Add 1 to the triggering unit's Wound rolls.
    - At the end of each phase, until the end of the phase, the triggering unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Purge the Foe" id="eca9-8db9-19f4-74f7" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="6fe0-3dbe-f7e0-10bb"/>
                <categoryLink name="Detachment Tag: mutant" id="328a-7cdf-f1a1-5b27" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="b993-d0ea-90c4-19d6"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Rubricae Phalanx" id="7510-5cb8-60fe-61a0" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="0ccc-0e40-8eef-2ac3" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="All is Dust" id="066c-2424-bc90-a455" hidden="false">
                  <description>When damage is allocated to a friendly RUBRICAE model, add 1 to this unit's saving throw rolls.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Priority Assets" id="e377-84ee-1b36-51a1" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="0936-9767-1cc7-52ae"/>
