            <profile name="Eruption of Vitality" id="de27-49a8-1b7b-cc5d" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the end of each phase, if this model was destroyed this phase (one or more times), once per battle per army, roll one D6: on a 2+, this model can be set up on the battlefield as close as possible to where it was destroyed more than 1" away from all enemy models, with 3 wounds remaining, as a separate unit with a Starting Strength of 1 (it is no longer part of its attached unit).
Applies to: THOUSAND SONS PSYKER units (excluding MONSTER units).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
