              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this unit starts a move, you can use this ability or when this unit ends a move, you can use this ability, use Soul Bound: during your Movement phase, select one friendly SEKHETAR ROBOTS unit within 3" of this model with the SEKHETAR ROBOTS keyword; that unit regains up to D3+1 lost wounds.
Kine‑shielded Guardians: while this model is within 3" of a friendly SEKHETAR ROBOTS unit, this model gains the Lone Operative ability.
Applies to: THOUSAND SONS SORCERER units.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
